{"id":"Waa4a2dc2b9108ef8fd96189d","zh":"声振耦合","en":"","name":"声振耦合","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Waa4a2dc2b9108ef8fd96189d","text":"声振耦合","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sf7aabfa0e4fb61e1c96c","source_id":"P139","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"研究声屏障声学性能时,建立更加详细的考虑开孔前板-多孔吸声材料-后板3 层夹芯板的精细化声振耦合模型,能够体现刚度、阻尼、质量和吻合控制对声屏障隔声性能的影响,主要原因在于当声波频率与声屏障板体固有频率相近时,形成的共振现象则会减弱声屏障的隔声性能, 导致声波发生透射传递至声影区。","citations":[{"source_id":"P139","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"S41715e36346872b5a7f4","source_id":"P139","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"本文提出的混合FEM- BEM 声振耦合预测模型可以在较小计算量的前提下, 满足在较高频率时声场辐射表述的准确性。","citations":[{"source_id":"P139","page":4,"page_end":4}]}],"sources":{"P139":{"id":"P139","title":"轨道交通声屏障多参数预测模型及降噪性能研究","authors":"宋杲,张小安,张晓芸,杨建近,徐磊,杨力","year":"2025","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2025.01.019","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"宋杲等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-research-on-multi-parameter-prediction-model-for-rail-transit-noise-barriers-and-noise-reduction-per"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"声压驱动板体振动、板体运动反馈声场的相互作用。","language":"zh","source_id":"P139","paper_slug":"2025-research-on-multi-parameter-prediction-model-for-rail-transit-noise-barriers-and-noise-reduction-per","title":"轨道交通声屏障多参数预测模型及降噪性能研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W98956b334aab8c268fd70a01","name":"Vibro-acoustic coupling","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W98956b334aab8c268fd70a01","name":"Vibro-acoustic coupling","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"